### Start diagnostics
# @name startDiagnostics
POST http://localhost:8080/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{$guid}}",
  "shipName": "USS Enterprise NCC-1701-D",
  "diagnosticsDate": "2370-04-08",
  "engineerName": "Geordi La Forge"
}


@instanceId={{startDiagnostics.response.body.workflowId}}
### Status
GET http://localhost:8080/status/{{instanceId}}

### Terminate
POST http://localhost:8080/terminate/{{instanceId}}

### Cancel
POST http://localhost:8080/cancel/{{instanceId}}
